1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,026
AstraHealth.

2
00:00:01,086 --> 00:00:03,350
A calmer way to check in.

3
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:06,737
On Mars, the flight surgeon is fourteen minutes away.

4
00:00:06,797 --> 00:00:10,700
AstraHealth turns the astronaut into the first line of
care.

5
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:11,803
Six body systems.

6
00:00:11,863 --> 00:00:18,500
One explainable readiness score, built on sleep, heart-
rate variability, and a personal baseline.

7
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,100
The check-in fills itself from sensors.

8
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:26,000
The Flight Surgeon sees the same record, early warning,
and cited guidance.

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,607
Guidance, not diagnosis.

10
00:00:28,667 --> 00:00:29,900
AstraHealth.

